# 统一行尾为 LF（跨平台一致，配合 prettier endOfLine: lf / black）
# 覆盖 git core.autocrlf 在 Windows 上把 LF 转 CRLF 的行为，避免 prettier 反复报错
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
